    "note": "House State Affairs engrossed, 2020-02-20; passed House 68-0 on 2020-02-24 (do pass amended); later amendments are not in the text read. Section 1 struck \"sixty-day\", added \"thirty-day\". Section 2 rewrites the renewal period (begins one-hundred eighty days before expiry, ends thirty days after); that sentence is garbled in the print and not quoted. Items (2)-(3) and the invalid-permit sentence are reconstructed from interleaved struck/added words (a stray \"a\" in the print dropped), so wording is close but not guaranteed character-exact."
